 qa:findingJson "{\"adr\": \"ADR-RUN-0013\", \"description\": \"The nine CFG/TRN omissions are corrected and all42 listed ADRs resolve, but the same owned-crate coverage check still omits Active ADR-RUN-0013. C3 owns crates/sc-cron/Cargo.toml at line123; docs/sc-cron/architecture.md:3 explicitly identifies ADR-RUN-0013 as binding for that crate. ADR-RUN-0017 permits the narrow temporary command logging edge and does not supersede the base optional cron/SQLite crate contract. No implementation violation is identified; this is one remaining existing-reference omission.\", \"evidence_refs\": [\"docs/plans/phase-c/sprint-c-3-runtime-ecosystem-upgrade.md:71\", \"docs/plans/phase-c/sprint-c-3-runtime-ecosystem-upgrade.md:123\", \"docs/sc-cron/architecture.md:3\", \"docs/architecture.md:2693\", \"docs/architecture.md:213\"], \"file\": \"docs/plans/phase-c/sprint-c-3-runtime-ecosystem-upgrade.md\", \"id\": \"ARCH-C3-QA8-001\", \"line\": 71, \"remediation\": \"Add the existing ADR-RUN-0013 to C3's single adrs list; preserve all ownership, source behavior and the42 current references. Recheck unique binding-reference resolution and owned-crate coverage. No new ADR, product change or scope recut is required.\", \"reviewer\": \"arch-qa\", \"rule\": \"RULE-ADR-PLAN\", \"severity\": \"BLOCKING\", \"source_commit\": \"863622417ee773d0d50ac3690fad5c78e2fa106e\"}" .
