 qa:findingJson "{\"category\": \"fmt\", \"evidence\": \".triage/c/findings/phase-c-source-end-qa1.ttl:75: new blank line at EOF.\", \"file\": \".triage/c/findings/phase-c-source-end-qa1.ttl\", \"id\": \"RUST-QA-C3-QA8-001\", \"issue\": \"The new triage file ends with an extra blank line; git diff --check exits2 on the exact current change.\", \"line\": 75, \"recommendation\": \"Remove the redundant blank line at EOF, preserving every Turtle statement and triage fact, then rerun git diff --check.\", \"reviewer\": \"rust-qa-agent\", \"severity\": \"minor\", \"source_commit\": \"863622417ee773d0d50ac3690fad5c78e2fa106e\"}" .
