 qa:findingJson "{\"category\": \"requirement-not-listed\", \"compliance_result\": \"partially-compliant\", \"id\": \"REQ-C6-QA6-001\", \"issue\": \"C6 now owns the actual production-tool and observability guard correction that implements REQ-RUN-0005 for sc-cron-commands, but the authoritative C6 requirements list omits REQ-RUN-0005. The corrected code enforces the requirement; its direct governing requirement is missing from sprint traceability.\", \"required_correction\": \"Add REQ-RUN-0005 to the existing C6 requirements list, preserving existing IDs, scope, source and all validation. No product or new enforcement mechanism is requested.\", \"reviewer\": \"req-qa\", \"severity\": \"Blocking\", \"source_commit\": \"62531676155934aa5b6bd9341114d1ec74fcb3ee\", \"source_refs\": [\".claude/agents/req-qa.md:88\", \"docs/requirements.md:447\", \"docs/requirements.md:488\"], \"target_refs\": [\"docs/plans/phase-c/sprint-c-6-standard-cron-commands.md:11\"]}" .
